wn.Space","Breakdown.gradientPairing","Breakdown.sumSecondPartialsAt"],"written":"SumSecondPartialsPairing"},{"axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"],"dependency_source":"lean_report","doc":null,"end_line":32,"kind":"def","line":30,"module":"Breakdown.Profile.StatementsField","name":"Breakdown.GradientPairingZero","namespace":"Breakdown","noncomputable":false,"noncomputable_section":true,"private":false,"proof_used_by":[],"proof_uses":[],"protected":false,"short":"GradientPairingZero","signature_end_line":30,"sorry":false,"statement_used_by":["Breakdown.gradientPairingZero_holds","Breakdown.physicalWeak_holds"],"statement_uses":["Breakdown.IsTestField","Breakdown.Space","Breakdown.gradientAt"],"used_by":["Breakdown.gradientPairingZero_holds","Breakdown.physicalWeak_holds"],"uses":["Breakdown.IsTestField","Breakdown.Space","Breakdown.gradientAt"],"written":"GradientPairingZero"}],"imports":["Breakdown.Base.Realization"],"module":"Breakdown.Profile.StatementsField","path":"Breakdown/Profile/StatementsField.lean","sha256":"d755236ae65e9935ff16cb4e5cb11544c70e901ce0a1880f4dc3176cbee875d4","source":"import Breakdown.Base.Realization\n\nopen scoped ContDiff\nopen MeasureTheory Set Real\n\nnoncomputable section\n\nnamespace Breakdown\n\ndef DecayFieldSub : Prop :=\n  ∀ f g : Space → Space, IsDecayField f → IsDecayField g → IsDecayField (f - g)\n\ndef DecayFieldDilate : Prop :=\n  ∀ (μ : ℝ) (f : Space → Space), 0 < μ → IsDecayField f → IsDecayField (dilateField μ f)\n\ndef DilateCalculus : Prop :=\n  ∀ (μ : ℝ) (f : Space → Space), ContDiff ℝ ∞ f → ∀ x : Space,\n    fderiv ℝ (dilateField μ f) x = (Real.sqrt μ ^ 2) • fderiv ℝ f (Real.sqrt μ • x) ∧\n    sumSecondPartialsAt (dilateField μ f) x = (Real.sqrt μ ^ 3) • sumSecondPartialsAt f (Real.sqrt μ • x) ∧\n    advectionAt (dilateField μ f) x = (Real.sqrt μ ^ 3) • advectionAt f (Real.sqrt μ • x)\n\ndef GradientScale : Prop :=\n  ∀ (c : ℝ) (g : Space → ℝ), ContDiff ℝ ∞ g → ∀ x : Space,\n    gradientAt (fun y => g (c • y)) x = c • gradientAt g (c • x)\n\ndef SumSecondPartialsPairing : Prop :=\n  ∀ f φ : Space → Space, ContDiff ℝ ∞ f → IsTestField φ →\n    ∫ x, inner ℝ (sumSecondPartialsAt f x) (φ x) = -gradientPairing f φ\n\ndef GradientPairingZero : Prop :=\n  ∀ (g : Space → ℝ) (φ : Space → Space), ContDiff ℝ ∞ g → IsTestField φ →\n    ∫ x, inner ℝ (gradientAt g x) (φ x) = 0\n\nend Breakdown\n"}